5:T44b,In the Nikunj, the divine couple is sitting together and Radharani seems to be in a good mood. At this time, Bihariji says to Priyaji Oh my most beloved Pyari, we both are residents of here and keep on enjoying each others company since ages so you keep on showering your love and kindness on me. It is due to you that I have got the name Kunj Bihari. Your love for me and my love for you is immeasurable. There are vibrating tones of music which enrich our love for each other. Every time I feel a new pleasure in your company. When Bihariji looks at the face of Radharani even the moon feels ashamed. Swami Shri Haridas Ji who was present there and listening to them smiled and commented ‘both of you are equal in beauty I cannot say who is more beautiful than the other and further commented that Radharani is expert in dancing and Bihariji loves to watch her dancing because it suits her slender figure and each part of her body is so beautiful hence it is natural that Bihariji will love to watch her dancing and Bihariji thanked her for being so kind to him by showing her dance performance.7:["slug","rag-raginina","d"]
0:["Xt0P2co0XkF6MKDXqPjpt",[[["",{"children":["hi",{"children":["ragas",{"children":[["slug","rag-raginina","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"rag-raginina\"}",{}]}]}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["hi",{"children":["ragas",{"children":[["slug","rag-raginina","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"name\":\"राग रागिनीन\",\"description\":\"राग राग रागिनीन में रचित पदों की सूची\",\"numberOfItems\":1,\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"url\":\"https://path.vrindopnishad.in/hi/content/kunjabihari-haun-teri-balai\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"मुख्यपृष्ठ\",\"item\":\"https://path.vrindopnishad.in/hi\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"राग\",\"item\":\"https://path.vrindopnishad.in/hi/ragas\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"राग रागिनीन\",\"item\":\"https://path.vrindopnishad.in/hi/ragas/rag-raginina\"}]}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-4 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-white/50 select-none","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/hi","className":"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors","children":"मुख्यपृष्ठ"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"→"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/hi/ragas","className":"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors","children":"राग"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/80 font-medium truncate","children":"राग रागिनीन"}]]}],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$L4",null,{"initialRaga":{"name":"राग रागिनीन","hinglishName":"rag raginina","slug":"rag-raginina","verses":[{"id":"local-319","title":"कुंजबिहारी हौं तेरी बलाइ","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"कुंजबिहारी हौं तेरी बलाइलेऊँ नीके हौ गावत।राग रागिनीन के जूथ उपजावत।।तैसीयै तैसी मिली जोरीप्रिया जू की मुख देखत चंद लजावत।श्रीहरिदास के स्वामी स्यामा कौनृत्य देखत काहि न भावत।।","hindi_text":"कुंजबिहारी की भावना है प्यारी जी आप मुझे अंग संग कर कुंजों विहार कर रही हैं , मैं आप की बलायें यानि बलिहारी पर लेता हूँ, आप अपनी कृपालुता बरसाती रहें , आप इसी भांति रहें , बोलें , गाती रहें । आप के आलिंगन से अनेक मनोरथ पूर्ण होते हैं , नये उपजते भी उपजते हैं । सखी बोली - प्रिया जी की मुख चन्द्र के आगे लाल जी का मुख चन्द्र फीका प्रतीत हो रहा है । प्रिया जी के अंग के सम्मुख प्रिय का अंग दब गया है या कहीं छिप गया है । हरिदासी सखी यहाँ सुख विलास रति में किन का नृत्य विशेष है , दर्शाना चाह रही हैं । श्री श्यामा जी का नृत्य श्वास है , यह सुन श्री श्याम जी प्रसन्नता से बोल पड़े , आप की कृपा से श्यामा प्यारी जी नृत्य कर रही हैं , सो मैं बलि बलि जाऊँ ।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"$5","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/59a1bdc359e8c72a534d85b5/kunjbihari-haun-teree-balaee-leun-pad-by-swami-shri-haridas-ji","author":"श्री हरिदास, केलिमाल (12)","status":"published","content_text":"(राग कान्हरौ)\nकुंजबिहारी हौं तेरी बलाइ\nलेऊँ नीके हौ गावत।\nराग रागिनीन के जूथ उपजावत।।\nतैसीयै तैसी मिली जोरी\nप्रिया जू की मुख देखत चंद लजावत।\nश्रीहरिदास के स्वामी स्यामा कौ\nनृत्य देखत काहि न भावत।।\n- श्री हरिदास, केलिमाल (12)\nकुंजबिहारी की भावना है प्यारी जी आप मुझे अंग संग कर कुंजों विहार कर रही हैं , मैं आप की बलायें यानि बलिहारी पर लेता हूँ, आप अपनी कृपालुता बरसाती रहें , आप इसी भांति रहें , बोलें , गाती रहें । आप के आलिंगन से अनेक मनोरथ पूर्ण होते हैं , नये उपजते भी उपजते हैं । सखी बोली - प्रिया जी की मुख चन्द्र के आगे लाल जी का मुख चन्द्र फीका प्रतीत हो रहा है । प्रिया जी के अंग के सम्मुख प्रिय का अंग दब गया है या कहीं छिप गया है । हरिदासी सखी यहाँ सुख विलास रति में किन का नृत्य विशेष है , दर्शाना चाह रही हैं । श्री श्यामा जी का नृत्य श्वास है , यह सुन श्री श्याम जी प्रसन्नता से बोल पड़े , आप की कृपा से श्यामा प्यारी जी नृत्य कर रही हैं , सो मैं बलि बलि जाऊँ ।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/59a1bdc359e8c72a534d85b5/kunjbihari-haun-teree-balaee-leun-pad-by-swami-shri-haridas-ji","slug":"kunjabihari-haun-teri-balai"}],"imageUrl":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","ragas","children","$7","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","ragas","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[null,["$","div",null,{"lang":"hi","children":["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]}]],null],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/cbf73327883ccb7f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","1",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/fe995a1e4635138b.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","2",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/848f1edf91a8622f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en","className":"dark","children":["$","body",null,{"className":"antialiased","children":["$","$L9",null,{"children":["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentP